    LLM: "Don't bid unless you have at least one Joker or two Aces. The Kitty is a gambleâ€”you hope it contains cards that 'fill' your suits.\n\nCounting the Kitty: The high bidder knows 18 cards (12 dealt + 6 kitty). They must use this information to deduce the location of the remaining Jokers and Aces.\n\nSignaling: Through the suit led and the timing of high card plays, partners signal their voids and their 'stops' in side suits. Mastering the lead is essential for 'setting' the opponents.",
